B.aGY=new A.S(B.KZ,["The interest test","We built a test that tells you what you actually want to study","Stand in front of every path at once. Answer honestly, and the result explains itself: why this specialty, and what in your answers led there.","Explore","Discover every domain in the world","85 specialties across computing, engineering, health, business, the humanities and agriculture \u2014 what you would actually study, what the work is really like, and what it pays.","Practical guides","Learn what forex actually is","The exchange machine behind global trade: market structure, pricing, the arithmetic of leverage, the regulatory picture and the fraud patterns. Written as an explanation, not a pitch.","Knowledge checks","Then test yourself on it","Ten questions, ten different model papers, and the reasoning appears the moment you answer. Retake it as often as you like \u2014 every sitting hands you the next model, with new questions.","Before you begin","Start now, and sign in whenever you like","No account, no email, no card. Everything above is open right now \u2014 and signing in stays there for whenever you want it.","85","specialties explained","6","major domains","10","model test papers","Skip the intro","Start now","Start without an account","Sign in or create an account later"],t.w)
